  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 4.7.5\n\n**NOTES**: This version contains breaking changes and removes some functionality.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n* Removed ``CommandRunner`` class\n* Removed ``ProcessRunner`` class\n* Removed ``PlatformKitIdentification`` class\n* Removed ``UrlRunner`` class\n\n### Other Changes\n* Updated DotExtensions from 7.3.0 to 7.6.5 for .NET Standard 2.0 users, and from 7.3.0 to 8.2.0 for .NET 8 and .NET 9 users\n* Updated Polyfill from 8.1.0 to 8.7.4",
